                     <body>cdi:references - the PrimaryKey on another DataStructure that this foreign key references.</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <lowerValue xmi:id="DiscoveryDataDescriptionStructure.ForeignKey-references-lowerValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.1/composite/xmi/#ForeignKey-references-lowerValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
